      "held": "The Bombay Registration of Marriages Act, 1953, the Karnataka Marriages (Registration and Miscellaneous Provisions) Act, 1976, the Himachal Pradesh Registration of Marriages Act, 1996, and the Andhra Pradesh Compulsory Registration of Marriages Act, 2002 provide for compulsory registration of marriages.",
